e_type":"document","source_file":"public/models/README.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null},{"id":"rationale_blurReveal","label":"Blur-to-Sharp Reveal Pattern","file_type":"rationale","source_file":"src/components/common/Reveal.jsx","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"description":"Adding blur to entry animations creates a cinematic 'focus pull' feel that aligns with the futuristic fine-dining aesthetic. The blur prop defaults true so all existing Reveal consumers get the upgrade automatically."},{"id":"rationale_warmPalette","label":"Warm Palette Rationale (Tone-Down)","file_type":"rationale","source_file":"fix2.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"description":"Electric teal (#6FF7E5) was removed from the design system because high-saturation cool accents read as 'sci-fi sports brand' rather than 'fine-dining house'. Replaced with warm burgundy (#A8323F) and brushed brass (#C9A961) to cue warmth, restraint, and confidence."},{"id":"rationale_i18nCustomContext","label":"Custom i18n Context Rationale","file_type":"rationale","source_file":"docs/superpowers/specs/2026-05-14-i18n-en-es-design.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"description":"No third-party i18n library (react-i18next, FormatJS) was used because the project is small enough for a custom Context with a simple dot-path lookup. This avoids bundle weight while keeping the architecture extensible for future languages."},{"id":"rationale_containerScrollPort","label":"ContainerScroll JSX Port Rationale","file_type":"rationale","source_file":"docs/superpowers/specs/2026-05-21-ardor-ui-overhaul-design.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"description":"The ContainerScroll component was ported from 21st.dev TSX to JS